{"version":3,"term":{"cols":130,"rows":40},"timestamp":1785740928,"command":"./scripts/cast-demo4.sh","title":"Demo 4 — the code is innocent: a CPU quota is the bug","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.140, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1mDemo 4 — the code is innocent: a CPU quota is the bug\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[90m~1.7s to do 141ms of arithmetic. No locks, no I/O, no sleep, and not one line of Go changes.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
