[0.003, "o", "\u001b[7m  Nothing anomalous. sha256 is on top because sha256 is the workload.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "  A CPU profile samples threads that are ON a CPU. This one was not.\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.173, "o", "\u001b[7m  ...except the header: Duration: 15.20s, Total samples = 3.52s (23.16%)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "  Sample time over wall clock, summed across threads. Compare the two modes:\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "  throttled lands near 25% (a quarter of one CPU), corrected near 200% (two).\r\n"]
[0.004, "o", "  Identical code, identical load — only the CPU it was granted differs.\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n"]
